.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH kakashi-probe 1  "probe " 
.SH NAME
kakashi\-probe \- Stage D boundary probing of `program` (§23, §24)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBkakashi probe\fR [\fB\-\-state\fR] [\fB\-\-timeout\-secs\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROGRAM\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stage D boundary probing of `program` (§23, §24)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-state\fR \fI<STATE>\fR [default: .]
Directory containing (or to contain) the `.kakashi/` state directory (§34)
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\-secs\fR \fI<TIMEOUT_SECS>\fR [default: 10]

.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: human]

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
human
.IP \(bu 2
json
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROGRAM\fR>

